ed, At the presence of God; Sinai there quaked At the presence of God, the God of Israel.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0776"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"trembled","s":["H7493"],"a":[1]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"heavens","s":["H8064"],"a":[3]},{"t":" also dripped, At the "},{"t":"presence","s":["H6440"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[6]},{"t":"; "},{"t":"Sinai","s":["H5514"],"a":[8]},{"t":" there quaked At the "},{"t":"presence","s":["H6440"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[10]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[11]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":9,"text":"You shed forth bountiful rain, O God; You confirmed Your inheritance when it languished.","tok":[{"t":"You shed forth bountiful "},{"t":"rain","s":["H1653"],"a":[0]},{"t":", O "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; You "},{"t":"confirmed","s":["H3559"],"a":[7]},{"t":" Your "},{"t":"inheritance","s":["H5159"],"a":[4]},{"t":" when it languished."}]},{"n":10,"text":"Your living flock dwelt in the land; In Your goodness You provided for the poor, O God.","tok":[{"t":"Your living flock "},{"t":"dwelt","s":["H3427"],"a":[1]},{"t":" in the land; In Your "},{"t":"goodness","s":["H2896"],"a":[4]},{"t":" You provided for the "},{"t":"poor","s":["H6041"],"a":[5]},{"t":", O "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":11,"text":"The Lord gives the command; The women who bear the glad tidings are a great host.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0136"],"a":[0]},{"t":" gives the command; The women who bear the glad tidings are a "},{"t":"great","s":["H7227"],"a":[5]},{"t":" host."}]},{"n":12,"text":"The kings of the armies flee. They flee! And she who abides at home Divides the spoil.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"kings","s":["H4428"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"armies","s":["H6635"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"flee","s":["H5074"],"a":[2]},{"t":". They flee! And she who abides at "},{"t":"home","s":["H1004"],"a":[5]},